    "badge": "Best Small Portable Washer",
    "amazonUrl": "",
    "pros": [
      "Small 0.9 cu ft footprint fits closets, dorms and RVs",
      "Fully automatic, same hookup as its bigger sibling",
      "Light enough to lift onto a stand or into a tub",
      "Low water use per load",
      "Simple controls"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "Small loads mean running it often",
      "Bulky items like comforters will not fit",
      "Needs a compatible faucet like any automatic"
