      "Light cabinet benefits from a level, firm floor"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "A strong alternative to the BLACK+DECKER at the same size, worth buying on whichever is in stock or cheaper.",
    "description": "Magic Chef has been selling compact laundry for small spaces for years, and the MCSTCW16W1 is its 1.6 cubic foot portable top-load washer. It covers the same ground as the BLACK+DECKER BPWM16W: a drum big enough for a couple of days of clothes, fully automatic operation once it is connected to the sink, and a cabinet that rolls into a closet when you are done. The main reasons to choose it are availability and pairing. It is widely stocked by big-box retailers, which makes returns and service easier, and Magic Chef sells compact 120V dryers that sit beside it if you want a matched pair. As with every portable, read the manual for the drain method and maximum drain height before you plan where it lives, and check that the included adapter fits your faucet. Owners commonly note that small washers like this one run more smoothly on a level, firm floor with balanced loads than on carpet or an uneven floor."
  },
  {
    "id": "panda-pan56mgp3-portable-washer",
